.SH NAME
git-bug-bug-status-merge - Mark a pull-request as merged


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit-bug bug status merge [BUG_ID] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Mark a pull-request as merged and record the merge commit hash. Only valid for bugs whose kind is pr.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-c\fP, \fB--commit\fP=""
	The merge commit hash. Required.

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for merge


